8.7%
1.7%
Ex: India's IIP grew at 4.9% for April 2026, marking the historic first release of data utilizing the updated 2022-23 base year (shifted from 2011-12). The index is released monthly by the NSO (MOSPI) and serves as a primary indicator for the RBI's monetary policy decisions. 

